# Downloads of fetch-deps.sh: GROUP SHA256 PATH URL (whitespace separated).
# PATH is relative to $LW_WORK; paths starting with vm/ are relative to $LWVM_WORK (default
# $LW_WORK/vm). Every sum comes from the upstream sha256sums file of the download directory, or,
# where upstream publishes none (GitHub releases, Ubuntu pool files), from the file as first fetched.
#
# ib      ImageBuilder for the router (ipq40xx/generic), build.sh
# extra   .apk files from outside the official feeds, copied into the ImageBuilder (packages.md)
# gawk    GNU awk for the ImageBuilder, only used when the host has no GNU awk
# rootfs  x86_64 rootfs the tests run in (tests/rootfs/run.sh), with coreutils-timeout added
# vm      x86_64 ImageBuilder of the VM bench (tests/vm)
# rescue  stock images for a recovery over the serial console (README "Recovery")

